### SafeRoute AI REST API Collection
### Base URL: http://localhost:8000/api

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api

### 1. Health Check & Active Course Outcomes (CO1-CO5)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/
Accept: application/json

### 2. City Metadata, Map Bounds & Default Sliders (Austin, TX)
GET {{baseUrl}}/meta/
Accept: application/json

### 3. Predictive Risk Assessment (CO5 XGBoost + CO4 Bayesian Marginals)
# Evaluates baseline accident likelihood under stormy night conditions
POST {{baseUrl}}/predict/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "weather": "Rain",
  "precipitation": 0.65,
  "visibility": 2.5,
  "traffic_density": 80.0,
  "hour": 22,
  "temperature": 52.0,
  "humidity": 85.0,
  "wind_speed": 12.0
}

### 4. Clear Sunny Day Prediction (Low Risk Baseline)
POST {{baseUrl}}/predict/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "weather": "Clear",
  "precipitation": 0.0,
  "visibility": 10.0,
  "traffic_density": 25.0,
  "hour": 14,
  "temperature": 75.0,
  "humidity": 45.0,
  "wind_speed": 5.0
}

### 5. Risk-Weighted A* Route vs Fastest Route (CO2 Informed Search)
# Computes safe path detouring around Austin downtown accident hotspots
POST {{baseUrl}}/route/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": [30.2672, -97.7431],
  "destination": [30.2850, -97.7340],
  "conditions": {
    "weather": "Rain",
    "precipitation": 0.50,
    "visibility": 3.0,
    "traffic_density": 75.0,
    "hour": 21
  },
  "safety_lambda": 2.0
}

### 6. Forward-Chaining Production Rules & Insurance Underwriting (CO3)
# Fires operational mandates (speed reduction, heavy vehicle diversion) and underwriting tier
POST {{baseUrl}}/rules/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conditions": {
    "weather": "Rain",
    "road_surface": "Wet",
    "precipitation": 0.70,
    "visibility": 2.0,
    "time_of_day": "Night",
    "traffic_density": 85.0,
    "risk_probability": 0.78
  },
  "route_stats": {
    "route_length_km": 24.5,
    "distance_miles": 15.2,
    "duration_minutes": 28.0
  }
}

### 7. Optimal Clear Day Rule Evaluation (Preferred Tier A)
POST {{baseUrl}}/rules/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conditions": {
    "weather": "Clear",
    "road_surface": "Dry",
    "visibility": 10.0,
    "time_of_day": "Day",
    "traffic_density": 20.0,
    "risk_probability": 0.15
  },
  "route_stats": {
    "route_length_km": 8.0
  }
}
